The SCEPTRE bennu module now records register read/write direction, I/O links, point options (DNP3 class, variations, deadband, SBO, Modbus min/max), client connections to remote servers, legacy SunSpec registers, internal tags, the event log file of each comms module (``<event-logging>``, in ``related.files``), the simulation network interface, and provider endpoints. A new container CI job boots the bennu VM image from `sceptre-phenix-images <https://github.com/sandialabs/sceptre-phenix-images>`__ and pulls from it with PEAT, using the new ``scripts/run-bennu-vm.sh``.
